        "id": 5036
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-15T15:25:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I wonder if this should be even higher, i.e. when we are picking what Renderers to use. Like should we just fail to make a Renderer if we won\u0027t be able to support multisampling? It\u0027s a similar issue to having input attachment support in vulkan on the resolve texture. Though the one down side about doing at the renderer level is that we may not know the final load values. Technically we could use framebufferOnly if the load is a discard or clear. But if we delay to make this decision than we have no chance to do a fallback.\n\nI think this is something we can discuss and try to plan out after this CL.",
      "parentUuid": "8cd96e45_03f90916",
